        "text": "Matteo Quintarelli (born 13 June 2007) is an Italian racing driver who lives in Dubai. He last competed in the 2024–25 Asian Le Mans Series with Ultimate AF Corse in the LMP3 Category. He previously competed in Formula 4 with Sainteloc Racing in the Formula 4 UAE Championship and F4 Spanish Championship respectively.\n\nHe is not related to fellow Italian racing driver Ronnie Quintarelli.",
